 decimal digits). The number's length does not exceed 1000 characters, including the dot. There are no other characters in the input data.\n\n## Output\n\nIf the last number of the integer part is not equal to 9 , print the rounded-up number without leading zeroes. Otherwise, print the message \" GOTO Vasilisa. \" (without the quotes).\n\n## Examples\n\nExample 1:\n```\n0.0\n```\n```\n0\n```","type":"text"}],"contestId":99,"index":"A","memoryLimit":"256 megabytes","name":"Help Far Away Kingdom","problemKey":"99-A","rating":null,"tags":[],"timeLimit":"2 seconds","url":"https://codeforces.com/contest/99/problem/A"},{"approaches":[{"label":"Approach 1","number":1,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 2","number":2,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 3","number":3,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 4","number":4,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 5","number":5,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 6","number":6,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 7","number":7,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 8","number":8,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 9","number":9,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 10","number":10,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 11","number":11,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 12","number":12,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 13","number":13,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 14","number":14,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName"